    {
      "gold_id": "ARG-GOLD-002",
      "title": "The Non-constructed I (objection \u2192 reply, V2-L)",
      "passage_id": "pt:passage:ipvv:chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana.md",
      "chunk": "chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana",
      "propositions": [
        {
          "proposition_id": "G2-OBJ",
          "text": "If reflexive awareness is joined to linguistic form, why is it not simply a conceptual construction (vikalpa)?",
          "kind": "OBJECTION",
          "explicitness": "TEXTUALLY_EXPLICIT",
          "speaker": "p\u016brvapak\u1e63a (objector)",
          "primary_evidence": [
            {
              "passage_id": "pt:passage:ipvv:chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana.md",
              "span_id": "chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana:L31:T112",
              "lemma": "vikalpatv\u0101\u015ba\u1e45k\u0101",
              "role": "the vikalpa-construction OBJECTION is raised (\u0101\u015ba\u1e45k\u0101)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "proposition_id": "G2-TC1",
          "text": "Conceptual construction (vikalpa) operates by combining, differentiating, or determining contents.",
          "kind": "TEXTUAL_CLAIM",
          "explicitness": "TEXTUALLY_SUPPORTED",
          "speaker": "siddh\u0101nta (Abhinavagupta)",
          "primary_evidence": [
            {
              "passage_id": "pt:passage:ipvv:chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana.md",
              "span_id": "chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana:L29:T93",
              "lemma": "vikalpa\u1e25",
              "role": "vikalpa as the two-invoking determination (dvay\u0101k\u1e63ep\u012b)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "proposition_id": "G2-TC2",
          "text": "The awareness expressed as 'I' (aha\u1e43-pratyavamar\u015ba) is not treated as one more relation constructed between independently given elements.",
          "kind": "TEXTUAL_CLAIM",
          "explicitness": "TEXTUALLY_EXPLICIT",
          "speaker": "siddh\u0101nta",
          "primary_evidence": [
            {
              "passage_id": "pt:passage:ipvv:chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana.md",
              "span_id": "chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana:L28:T87",
              "lemma": "aha\u1e43",
              "role": "'I'"
            },
            {
              "passage_id": "pt:passage:ipvv:chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana.md",
              "span_id": "chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana:L28:T88",
              "lemma": "pratyavamar\u015bo",
              "role": "reflexive awareness"
            },
            {
              "passage_id": "pt:passage:ipvv:chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana.md",
              "span_id": "chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana:L29:T93",
              "lemma": "vikalpa\u1e25",
              "role": "negated: n\u0101sau vikalpa\u1e25 = 'that is not vikalpa'"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "proposition_id": "G2-CONC",
          "text": "Linguistic articulation does not show that the underlying self-awareness is itself produced by conceptual determination.",
          "kind": "CONCLUSION",
          "explicitness": "RECONSTRUCTED_NECESSARY",
          "speaker": "siddh\u0101nta",
          "primary_evidence": [
            {
              "passage_id": "pt:passage:ipvv:chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana.md",
              "span_id": "chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana:L28:T88",
              "lemma": "pratyavamar\u015bo",
              "role": "reflexive awareness that is v\u0101gvapu\u1e25 (word-body) yet n\u0101sau vikalpa\u1e25"
            },
            {
              "passage_id": "pt:passage:ipvv:chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana.md",
              "span_id": "chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana:L29:T93",
              "lemma": "vikalpa\u1e25",
              "role": "explicitly negated"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "proposition_id": "G2-IC1",
          "text": "Abhinavagupta preserves a distinction between reflexive self-awareness and the conceptual operations that articulate it.",
          "kind": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
          "explicitness": "INTERPRETIVE_EXTENSION",
          "speaker": "reviewer's reconstruction",
          "primary_evidence": [
            {
              "passage_id": "pt:passage:ipvv:chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana.md",
              "span_id": "chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana:L28:T87",
              "lemma": "aha\u1e43"
            },
            {
              "passage_id": "pt:passage:ipvv:chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana.md",
              "span_id": "chunkV2-L-sastho-vimarsa-smrti-apohana:L29:T93",
